## c1-do-nothing (lane at base; live tree carries the inherited baseclean.out)
MISMATCH c1-do-nothing want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D1a relocated copy committed, root file left untracked
MISMATCH c1-D1a want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D1b relocated copy with different bytes, root clean
MISMATCH c1-D1b want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D2a correction whose numbers disagree with the cited receipt
MISMATCH c1-D2a want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D2b fabricated receipt agreeing with its correction
MISMATCH c1-D2b want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D2c valid correction but the filed SCORECARD row rewritten in place
MISMATCH c1-D2c want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D3a supersede row with a fabricated quote
MISMATCH c1-D3a want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-F-D3b supersede row valid but S463 scope rewritten in place
MISMATCH c1-D3b want=met=false got=met=true
## c1-positive all three fixed in the fixture
controls ok 1/9
exit=1
